// 5/3/1 with a core-stability block: four days (press, deadlift, bench,
// squat), four weeks, the last a deload. Each day runs: dynamic stretching,
// core work, the main lift, accessories, foam rolling, static stretching.
//
// The 1RM lines below are TRAINING MAXES, which is what Wendler's
// percentages are taken from: about 85% of a recent estimated 1RM for the
// lifts that have been off a while (squat, deadlift, press) and 90% for
// bench. Edit them before generating; add 5lb (upper) / 10lb (lower) each
// cycle. The + set is as many good reps as you have.
//
// Core pairs (Big 3 variations): press - side plank leg lift, 6-position
// carry; deadlift - around the worlds, renegade rows; bench - Milco bench
// press, ab-wheel rollout; squat - cable chops and lifts, stir the pot.
// Chops and lifts runs 4 sets: chop left, chop right, lift left, lift right.
// Side plank leg lift counts both sides in a set (8 a side).
// Dynamic stretching, foam rolling and static stretching are marked ~ :
// they land on the day as mobility work. Core and lifts don't.
// Overhead Press 1RM: 120lb
// Deadlift 1RM: 290lb
// Flat Barbell Bench Press 1RM: 225lb
// Barbell Squat 1RM: 245lb

## Week 1 - Press
// Dynamic stretching
Arm Circles / 1x2 30s rest 10s ~
Cat-Cow / 1x1 60s ~
Standing Thoracic Rotation / 1x2 30s rest 10s ~
World's Greatest Stretch / 1x2 40s rest 10s ~
// Core
Side Plank Leg Lift / 2x16
6 Position Carry Drill / 2x6 35lb 30s rest 10s after 90s
// Main lift
Overhead Press / 1x5 65%, 1x5 75%, 1x5+ 85%
// Accessories
Pull Up / 3x8
Cable Face Pull / 3x15 40lb
Lateral Dumbbell Raise / 3x12 20lb
// Foam roll
Foam Roll Thoracic Spine / 1x1 60s ~
Foam Roll Lats / 1x2 45s rest 10s ~
// Static stretching
Doorway Pec Stretch / 1x2 45s rest 10s ~
Thoracic Extension Over Chair / 1x1 60s ~

## Week 1 - Deadlift
// Dynamic stretching
Cat-Cow / 1x1 60s ~
Leg Swings / 1x2 30s rest 10s ~
Hip Airplane / 1x2 40s rest 10s ~
World's Greatest Stretch / 1x2 40s rest 10s ~
// Core
Around the Worlds / 3x10 20lb
Renegade Rows / 3x8 30lb
// Main lift
Deadlift / 1x5 65%, 1x5 75%, 1x5+ 85%
// Accessories
Bulgarian Split Squat / 3x8
Hip Thrust / 3x10 155lb
// Foam roll
Foam Roll Glutes / 1x2 45s rest 10s ~
Foam Roll Quads / 1x2 45s rest 10s ~
// Static stretching
Hamstring Stretch / 1x2 60s rest 10s ~
Pigeon Stretch / 1x2 60s rest 10s ~

